sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Queue
  participant Worker
  User->>UI: Explicit screen-face mode
  UI->>API: prepareLayout(clip, sourceRevision)
  API->>DB: authorized cache lookup
  alt Cache ready / unavailable / pending
    DB-->>UI: existing state, no new logical operation
  else Absent
    API->>DB: ensure pending seed
    API->>Queue: deterministic seed identity, priority1024
    Queue->>Worker: claim seed
    Worker->>DB: CAS lease epoch, max2 attempts
    Worker->>Worker: native FFmpeg / YuNet, deadline30s
    Worker->>DB: final CAS ready / unavailable
  end
  UI->>API: read-only layoutInfo
  API-->>UI: seed proposal or explained fallback
